, a window-grey page with lighter panels, outlined buttons that take an accent frame on hover, solid accent selections and a light title bar in Noto Sans.","font":"Noto Sans","matching":{"light":"breeze","dark":"breeze-dark"},"fonts":[{"package":"noto-sans","weights":[400,500,600,700]}],"order":30},{"id":"win11","label":"Windows 11","description":"Fluent: rounded, light shadows, accent underline on fields and smooth slide-in motion in Segoe UI Variable.","font":"Segoe UI Variable","matching":{"light":"win11","dark":"win11-dark"},"fonts":[{"package":"open-sans","weights":[400,600,700]}],"order":40},{"id":"win10","label":"Windows 10","description":"Flat and square with crisp 2 px borders and quick transitions in Segoe UI.","font":"Segoe UI","matching":{"light":"win10","dark":"win10-dark"},"fonts":[{"package":"open-sans","weights":[400,600,700]}],"order":50},{"id":"win7","label":"Windows 7","description":"Aero: glass window frames, grey gel buttons with a blue glow and a red close button in Segoe UI.","font":"Segoe UI","matching":{"light":"win7","dark":"win7-dark"},"fonts":[{"package":"open-sans","weights":[400,600,700]}],"order":60},{"id":"winxp","label":"Windows XP","description":"Luna: bevelled buttons, blue title bars, orange hover rings, instant menus and Tahoma.","font":"Tahoma","matching":{"light":"winxp"},"order":70},{"id":"win98","label":"Windows 98","description":"Classic: grey bevelled 3D controls, navy title bars, no animation and MS Sans Serif style type.","font":"Tahoma","matching":{"light":"win98"},"order":80},{"id":"macos","label":"macOS (Big Sur to Sequoia)","description":"Apple's flat 2020s look: 10 px windows, flat blue default buttons, a see-through sidebar and toolbar, sheet-style dialogs, in SF.","font":"system-ui","matching":{"light":"macos","dark":"macos-dark"},"order":90},{"id":"aqua","label":"Mac OS X Aqua (2001-09)","description":"Cheetah to Snow Leopard: pinstriped windows, glossy gel capsule buttons with a pulsing default, jewel traffic lights and a blue source list in Lucida Grande.","font":"Lucida Grande","matching":{"light":"aqua"},"order":100},{"id":"toolbar","label":"Standard v1","description":"The first version's look: bordered cover tiles, uppercase black headings, a wordmark and a three-column player. Pairs with the Standard v1 colours; its toolbar arrangement is the Standard v1 layout, which any look can use.","font":"system-ui","matching":{"light":"zinc","dark":"zinc"},"order":110},{"id":"liquid","label":"macOS Liquid Glass","description":"Apple's Liquid Glass: translucent floating bars that bend the light behind them, rim highlights, springy press and morphing menus.","font":"SF Pro","matching":{"light":"macos","dark":"macos-dark"},"effects":["liquid-glass"],"order":120},{"id":"holo","label":"Android Holo (4.x, 2011-13)","description":"Ice Cream Sandwich to KitKat: black and cyan, square flat controls, an action bar with a blue rule, underlined tabs and fields, blue-titled dialogs in Roboto.","font":"Roboto","matching":{"light":"holo-light","dark":"holo-dark"},"fonts":[{"package":"roboto","weights":[400,500,700]}],"order":130},{"id":"winamp","label":"Winamp 2 (classic skin)","description":"The 1998 media player: dark bevelled metal, striped title bars, a black playlist with green LCD text and a navy selection, in tiny Arial.","font":"Arial","matching":{"light":"winamp"},"order":140},{"id":"lgux","label":"LG Optimus: Marshmallow theme","description":"The pink Marshmallow home-screen theme of LG Optimus UI 3.0 (2012-13), redone from its screenshot: flat pastel pink, thin rose frames, translucent white panels, a dark status bar and a rose page indicator.","font":"Nunito","matching":{"light":"lg-marshmallow","dark":"lg-marshmallow-dark"},"fonts":[{"package":"nunito","weights":[400,600,800]},{"package":"fredoka","weights":[500,600]}],"effects":["ripple"],"order":150},{"id":"fortnite1","label":"Fortnite Chapter 1 (2017-19)","description":"Slanted buttons and panels, hard drop shadows, a yellow Play button and condensed capitals on bright blue.","font":"Burbank Big Condensed","matching":{"light":"fortnite-1","dark":"fortnite-1"},"fonts":[{"package":"noto-sans","weights":[400,500,600,700]},{"package":"barlow-condensed","weights":[400,600,700,800,900],"italic":[700,800,900]}],"order":160},{"id":"fortnite2","label":"Fortnite Chapter 2-3 (2019-23)","description":"The same slant on deep navy with see-through blue panels and a glowing Play button.","font":"Burbank Big Condensed","matching":{"light":"fortnite-2","dark":"fortnite-2"},"fonts":[{"package":"barlow-condensed","weights":[400,600,700,800,900],"italic":[700,800,900]}],"order":170},{"id":"fortnite4","label":"Fortnite Chapter 4 Rift UI (2023)","description":"The lobby redesign: rounded shapes on purple, options down the left side, in Heading Now.","font":"Heading Now","matching":{"light":"fortnite-4","dark":"fortnite-4"},"fonts":[{"package":"archivo","weights":[400,600,700,800,900],"italic":[700,800]}],"order":180},{"id":"fortnite5","label":"Fortnite Chapter 5-6 (2024-)","description":"Rift UI refined: less rounding and blue instead of purple.","font":"Heading Now","matching":{"light":"fortnite-5","dark":"fortnite-5"},"fonts":[{"package":"archivo","weights":[400,600,700,800,900],"italic":[700,800]}],"order":190},{"id":"pipboy","label":"Pip-Boy 3000 (Fallout)","description":"Green phosphor on black: one hue, square frames, glowing type, scan lines and menus that pick by inverting.","font":"VT323","matching":{"light":"pipboy","dark":"pipboy"},"fonts":[{"package":"vt323","weights":[400]}],"order":200},{"id":"persona","label":"Persona 5","description":"Black, red and white with hard offset shadows, italic capitals, solid red selection and white edges.","font":"Anton","matching":{"light":"persona","dark":"persona"},"fonts":[{"package":"anton","weights":[400]},{"package":"barlow-condensed","weights":[400,600,700,800,900],"italic":[700,800,900]}],"order":210},{"id":"gameboy","label":"Game Boy (DMG-01)","description":"The four greens of the original LCD, 2 px square frames, hard shadows, inverted picks and Press Start 2P type. Covers are tinted green.","font":"Press Start 2P","matching":{"light":"dmg","dark":"dmg"},"fonts":[{"package":"press-start-2p","weights":[400]},{"package":"vt323","weights":[400]}],"order":220},{"id":"zune","label":"Zune HD (Metro)","description":"Black with huge light lowercase titles, boxless content, white outlined controls and one orange accent that marks where you are.","font":"Segoe UI Light","matching":{"light":"zune","dark":"zune"},"fonts":[{"package":"open-sans","weights":[300]}],"order":230},{"id":"cyber","label":"Cyberpunk 2077","description":"Near-black with caution-tape yellow and cyan glints, chamfered corners, condensed capitals and solid yellow selection bars.","font":"Barlow Condensed","matching":{"light":"cyber","dark":"cyber"},"fonts":[{"package":"barlow-condensed","weights":[400,600,700,800,900],"italic":[700,800,900]}],"order":240},{"id":"blocky","label":"Minecraft (Bedrock)","description":"The game’s dark settings screens: slate panels with black outlines, a light header bar, light grey buttons, two-part green on/off switches, green sliders and pixel type.","font":"VT323","matching":{"light":"inventory","dark":"inventory"},"fonts":[{"package":"pixelify-sans","weights":[400,500,700]}],"order":250},{"id":"oneui","label":"Samsung One UI","description":"Big rounded squircle panels, frosted translucent tiles, round pill controls and thick pill sliders with a white fill. It has no colours of its own beyond the Samsung blue: the lilac in screenshots is the wallpaper, so choose a picture under Wallpaper.","font":"Outfit","matching":{"light":"oneui","dark":"oneui-dark"},"fonts":[{"package":"outfit","weights":[400,500,600]}],"order":260},{"id":"genius","label":"Genius","description":"White pages, black type and the yellow highlighter: flat square controls with black outlines, yellow hover and selection, bold headings.","font":"Helvetica Neue","matching":{"light":"genius","dark":"genius-dark"},"order":270},{"id":"spotify","label":"Spotify","description":"Black canvas with floating rounded dark panels, bold muted navigation, green pill buttons, tiles that lighten on hover and a white round play button.","font":"Figtree","matching":{"light":"spotify","dark":"spotify"},"fonts":[{"package":"albert-sans","weights":[400,500,600,700,800]}],"order":280},{"id":"ytmusic","label":"YouTube Music","description":"Flat near-black pages, pill chips and search, rounded thumbnails, a rounded grey highlight on the current page and a red progress bar.","font":"Roboto","matching":{"light":"ytmusic","dark":"ytmusic"},"fonts":[{"package":"roboto","weights":[400,500,700]}],"order":290},{"id":"discord","label":"Discord","description":"Layered slate panels, 4 px corners, blurple buttons, a recessed dark search field, rounded hover bars and a bold channel-list sidebar.","font":"Noto Sans","matching":{"light":"discord-light","dark":"discord-onyx"},"fonts":[{"package":"noto-sans","weights":[400,500,600,700]}],"order":300},{"id":"ado","label":"Ado","description":"Stage-black and electric blue with a hot red edge: condensed italic capitals, thin glowing outlines, a slash before page titles and square controls that light up.","font":"Barlow Condensed","matching":{"light":"ado","dark":"ado"},"fonts":[{"package":"archivo","weights":[400,600,700,800,900],"italic":[700,800]},{"package":"barlow-condensed","weights":[400,600,700,800,900],"italic":[700,800,900]}],"order":310},{"id":"yaru","label":"Yaru (Ubuntu)","description":"Ubuntu's GNOME theme: libadwaita shapes with the Ubuntu typeface and the orange accent.","font":"Ubuntu","matching":{"light":"yaru","dark":"yaru-dark"},"fonts":[{"package":"ubuntu","weights":[400,500,700]}],"order":320},{"id":"material","label":"Material 3","description":"Pill buttons, tonal surfaces, filled fields with an underline and rounded dialogs in Roboto.","font":"Roboto","matching":{"light":"material","dark":"m